WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,980 --> 00:00:03,280
I didn't harass him. I really didn't harass him.

2
00:00:03,280 --> 00:00:04,880
My daughter fucks harder and bigger than him

3
00:00:04,880 --> 00:00:06,280
How could I possibly harass him?

4
00:00:06,280 --> 00:00:07,880
Doesn’t this bully me as an honest person?

5
00:00:07,880 --> 00:00:09,680
Brother, we can adjust the monitoring

6
00:00:09,680 --> 00:00:11,480
Think about it carefully again

7
00:00:11,480 --> 00:00:13,080
Are you sure he harassed you?

8
00:00:13,080 --> 00:00:14,980
Or maybe someone else is harassing you

9
00:00:14,980 --> 00:00:16,880
Or maybe there are too many of them and they crowd you.

10
00:00:16,880 --> 00:00:18,430
You think clearly

11
00:00:18,430 --> 00:00:20,130
If you say that you are unfair and unfair

12
00:00:20,130 --> 00:00:21,630
We'll check the monitoring later

13
00:00:21,630 --> 00:00:23,430
I found out that the surveillance is not what you said.

14
00:00:23,430 --> 00:00:24,630
We will report it to the security team

15
00:00:24,630 --> 00:00:26,030
This is called frame-up

16
00:00:26,030 --> 00:00:28,060
I just want to pay this old man some money

17
00:00:28,060 --> 00:00:30,360
Why is it so troublesome? Of course

18
00:00:30,360 --> 00:00:32,060
If it is found out that he really harassed you

19
00:00:32,060 --> 00:00:33,960
Then we will naturally act impartially

20
00:00:33,960 --> 00:00:36,360
Send his cow to the government

21
00:00:36,360 --> 00:00:38,710
It's possible that there were too many people just now.

22
00:00:38,710 --> 00:00:39,710
I didn't pay attention

23
00:00:39,710 --> 00:00:42,510
Maybe someone accidentally bumped into me, so forget it and it'll be fine.

24
00:00:42,510 --> 00:00:43,910
Everyone keep dancing your dance

25
00:00:46,570 --> 00:00:48,070
I had agreed with Dr. Zhu at the beginning

26
00:00:48,070 --> 00:00:49,370
Just pretend to be his boyfriend

27
00:00:49,370 --> 00:00:50,970
The relationship is now over

28
00:00:50,970 --> 00:00:52,570
Of course there is no need to say hello to Zhu Ziran

29
00:00:52,570 --> 00:00:55,170
Anyway, Zhu Ziran looks down on him for being so small.

30
00:00:55,170 --> 00:00:57,470
Thank you very much for cleaning up Qingyuan for me just now. You're welcome.
